## 7. Controller Model Attribution

Parts of the controller artwork/model used by N3DCO are based on **Xbox Controller** by **wilsonR**, originally distributed under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** licence.

The original model has been modified for use within N3DCO, including modifications to geometry, materials, UV mapping, control separation and other visual elements.

The original creator does not endorse, sponsor or otherwise represent N3DCO.

The CC BY 4.0 licence applicable to that model does **not** automatically apply to N3DCO's proprietary application source code.

The original CC BY 4.0 licence is available at:

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

